  <issue>
  OpenTracing segments are orphans instead of children of the root span
Saleor is using `start_span` instead of `start_active_span` which is resulting to having a trace for each span instead of a segment, making the tracing close to useless.

On top, we should add a test(s) using MockTracer to ensure it does not break in the future.
